---
import Base from '../../layouts/Base.astro';
const base = import.meta.env.BASE_URL; // e.g. "/emoria/"
---

<Base lang="en" title="About us — EMORIA" current="About us"
  description="EMORIA's founder has more than ten years of experience in a wide range of social and educational settings.">
  <article class="bg-[var(--color-cream)]">
    <div class="mx-auto max-w-3xl px-6 pb-14 pt-36 text-center">
      <p class="text-sm font-semibold uppercase tracking-[0.18em] text-[var(--color-brand)]">✦ About us</p>
      <h1 class="mt-3 text-4xl sm:text-6xl">About us</h1>
    </div>

    <div class="mx-auto grid max-w-3xl items-start gap-10 px-6 pb-24 sm:grid-cols-[auto_1fr]">
      <img src={`${base}img/yubuu-headshot.png`} alt="Yubuu" loading="lazy"
        class="mx-auto h-40 w-auto drop-shadow-[0_16px_26px_rgba(43,42,40,0.16)] sm:h-52" />
      <div class="space-y-6 text-lg text-[var(--color-ink-soft)]">
        <p>EMORIA's founder has more than ten years of experience in a wide range of social and educational settings: inclusive kindergartens, schools including special needs schools, intensive residential groups, counselling services, and youth and family support.</p>
        <p>One thing became clearer with every experience: feelings shape our lives and our decisions far more than we often realise. They influence how we approach others, how we handle conflict and how we understand ourselves. And yet many adults only learned to talk about them late in life, or never did. It is a gap that is often passed on, unnoticed, to the next generation.</p>
        <p>That is exactly why it mattered to the founder that children and young people learn early on to recognise their feelings and talk about them. Every child should have the chance, within the education system, to get to know their feelings and to talk about them, whatever setting they grow up in. If children don't learn it in kindergarten, at school or at home, where else will they?</p>
        <p class="italic text-[var(--color-ink)]">EMORIA grew out of that belief.</p>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="mx-auto max-w-2xl px-6 pb-20 text-center">
      <a href={`${base}en/ueber-emoria`} class="font-[var(--font-body)] font-semibold text-[var(--color-brand)] hover:text-[var(--color-brand-deep)]">More about EMORIA →</a>
    </div>
  </article>
</Base>
